glowing leafy vines now run along her legs and hips, and a bright golden ribbon of light swirls around her hips with sparkles. The change from the start frame must be obvious at a glance. Expressive facial detail, subsurface scattering, octane render, 8k, stylized realism only, never photorealistic, no additional text, captions, or watermarks overlaid on the image\\n\\nNegative prompt: photorealistic, photograph, real photography, DSLR, stock photo, live action, real human skin, skin pores, skin wrinkles, realistic hair strands, product photography lighting, no text, no labels, no UI, no props\",\n48\t      \"prompt_video\": \"Pixar-Disney style 3D animation, image-to-video from the start frame to the end frame, 5s. Vertical 9:16.\\nCamera: locked-off static camera, no zoom.\\nMotion: the faint golden vines inside her legs light up and grow brighter, a golden ribbon of light spirals around her hips, and her hips, seat and thighs smoothly fill out into curves until the jeans fit snug; she places a hand on her hip and smiles at the camera.\\nLighting: warm cinematic glow\",\n49\t      \"referencias\": [\"protagonista-antes\"]\n50\t    },\n51\t    {\n52\t      \"n\": 3,\n53\t      \"tipo\": \"A\",\n54\t      \"duracion\": 2.1,\n55\t      \"linea\": \"Desde tu primera cápsula, el aguaje,\",\n56\t      \"prompt_imagen_inicial\": \"Vertical 9:16. Pixar-Disney style 3D animation render in the cinematic look of a Zack D Films explainer short. Close-up from the chest up of the same adult Colombian woman in her late 20s from the first reference image, with adult facial features, long voluminous wavy dark brown hair, warm tan skin and big warm brown eyes, wearing an emerald-green t-shirt, in a warm cozy kitchen softly blurred behind her. She holds the closed AGUAJE COMPLEX 3 EN 1 bottle from the product reference image up beside her cheek, at the same distance from the camera as her face, label facing the camera, about 40 percent of the frame height: a cylindrical bottle about